a Vardhana Reddy specializes in arthroscopic meniscus surgery at Yashoda Hospital, Hyderabad, prioritizing meniscus preservation when possible."}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-primary text-xs font-medium mt-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1 group-hover:gap-2 transition-all","children":["Learn more ",["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-right w-3 h-3","children":[["$","path","mthhwq",{"d":"m9 18 6-6-6-6"}],"$undefined"]}]]}]]}],["$","$L2","osgood-schlatter",{"href":"/conditions/osgood-schlatter","className":"bg-card border border-border hover:border-primary hover:shadow-md rounded-xl p-5 transition-all group","data-testid":"condition-card-osgood-schlatter","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground group-hover:text-primary transition-colors text-sm mb-2","children":"Osgood-Schlatter Disease Treatment in Hyderabad"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs text-muted-foreground line-clamp-2","children":"Osgood-Schlatter disease causes knee pain in growing adolescents, especially those active in sports. It affects the bump below the kneecap where the patellar tendon attaches. Dr. B Harsha Vardhana Reddy provides expert pediatric orthopedic care at Apollo Hospitals, Financial District, Hyderabad."}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-primary text-xs font-medium mt-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1 group-hover:gap-2 transition-all","children":["Learn more ",["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-right w-3 h-3","children":[["$","path","mthhwq",{"d":"m9 18 6-6-6-6"}],"$undefined"]}]]}]]}],["$","$L2","osteoarthritis",{"href":"/conditions/osteoarthritis",